* dual_bjt.lib
* Subcircuit models for dual-transistor BJT packages
*
* MBT3904DW1 — dual NPN (SOT-363, SC-70-6)
*   Package pins: 1=E1, 2=B1, 3=C2, 4=E2, 5=B2, 6=C1
*   KiCad Sim.Pins = "6 2 1 3 5 4"  (order: C1 B1 E1 C2 B2 E2)
*
* MBT3906DW1 — dual PNP (SOT-363, SC-70-6)
*   Same package pinout as MBT3904DW1
*   KiCad Sim.Pins = "6 2 1 3 5 4"

* Generic NPN model (approximates 2N3904/MMBT3904)
.model GENERIC_NPN NPN (Is=1e-14 Bf=200 Br=20 Vaf=100 Rb=10 Re=0.5 Rc=1
+  Cje=4p Vje=0.7 Mje=0.33 Cjc=2p Vjc=0.7 Mjc=0.33 Tf=300p)

* Generic PNP model (approximates 2N3906/MMBT3906)
.model GENERIC_PNP PNP (Is=1e-14 Bf=200 Br=20 Vaf=100 Rb=10 Re=0.5 Rc=1
+  Cje=4p Vje=0.7 Mje=0.33 Cjc=2p Vjc=0.7 Mjc=0.33 Tf=300p)

* MBT3904DW1: dual NPN, independent transistors
* Port order: c1 b1 e1 c2 b2 e2
.subckt MBT3904DW1 c1 b1 e1 c2 b2 e2
Q1 c1 b1 e1 GENERIC_NPN
Q2 c2 b2 e2 GENERIC_NPN
.ends MBT3904DW1

* MBT3906DW1: dual PNP, independent transistors
* Port order: c1 b1 e1 c2 b2 e2
.subckt MBT3906DW1 c1 b1 e1 c2 b2 e2
Q1 c1 b1 e1 GENERIC_PNP
Q2 c2 b2 e2 GENERIC_PNP
.ends MBT3906DW1
